  "description": "Heritage Road. Stainless Steel\n\nINOX is a living piece of Stelbel history. Introduced in the early 1980s, it represents one of the most daring and visionary projects ever developed by Stelio Belletti. Today, INOX returns as a modern interpretation of that original idea, faithful in spirit and design, yet refined through decades of experience. Built entirely in stainless steel and paired with a fully handcrafted steel fork, it offers a riding experience that remains deeply satisfying and remarkably relevant. A bicycle created for those who seek something timeless, distinctive and profoundly rewarding to ride.",
